745 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 156 0 R
/T (With FetchType.LAZY \(the default\), accessing offers outside a transaction causes LazyInitializationException. The session is already closed by the time forEach tries to load the collection. Wrap in a @Transactional method and return a new ArrayList to force loading while the session is still open.)
/E (With FetchType.LAZY \(the default\), accessing offers outside a transaction causes LazyInitializationException. The session is already closed by the time forEach tries to load the collection. Wrap in a @Transactional method and return a new ArrayList to force loading while the session is still open.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
